3. figures not closed under the stated rule: the body says "Every window is closed ... the figures are a function of the refs, not of main's tip" but pr_facts takes each PR's last verdict over the whole bus and reads delivery rows and merges at --tree (default origin/main). PR 2529's merge verdict at 18:50Z on 8f026328d moves it from product False to True, so L1's product row reads 0.12 (1/8) not 0.14 (1/7) and the product re-weight 0.86 not 0.85 (ev/product_cutoff.txt). Fix one of two ways: compute facts as of the window's until (an --as-of with --tree pinned and the verdict cut at the window end), or withdraw the closure claim and pin the bus/tree SHAs in the record. Re-take every figure the fact strata touch (origin, size, product, fixer first-pass, PR-mix null control) under the chosen rule and show the reproduction command reproduces them now.
